  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n**Logic:**\n\n \n• Numbers at odd position: (Number ÷ 2) - 4 \n \n• Numbers at even position: (Number ÷ 2) - 2\n\n(19216 ÷ 2) - 4 = 9608 - 4 = 9604\n\n(9604 ÷ 2) - 2 = 4802 - 2 = 4800\n\n(4800 ÷ 2) - 4 = 2400 - 4 = 2396\n\n(2396 ÷ 2) - 2 = 1198 - 2 = 1196\n\n(1196 ÷ 2) - 4 = 598 - 4 = **594**\n\n(594 ÷ 2) - 2 = 297 - 2 = 295\n\nHence, '**594**' is the correct answer.",
